{"base":{"webm":"/voice/first-day-intro-base-220dc46b9bb6.webm","m4a":"/voice/first-day-intro-base-220dc46b9bb6.m4a","lines":{"me|First day. Breathe.":[0,2308],"boss|Attention, everyone!":[2458,1155],"boss|Everyone, meet our new member! Say hi!":[3762,2825],"me|Hi everyone! Please take care of me!":[6738,2835],"boss|Take care of you? Are you sick?":[9723,2917],"me|Hi! Sorry, my English isn't great!":[12789,2883],"boss|Hey, no need to apologize!":[15822,1939],"me|Looking forward to working with you!":[17911,1519],"boss|Love the energy! Welcome aboard!":[19581,2211],"me|Hi everyone! Please look after me!":[21941,2574],"boss|Look after you? Like a babysitter?":[24665,2594]}},"followUp":{"webm":"/voice/first-day-intro-followUp-c2db6493d849.webm","m4a":"/voice/first-day-intro-followUp-c2db6493d849.m4a","lines":{"boss|Nice! Very nice!":[0,2035],"boss|Don't be nervous, okay?":[2185,1294],"boss|Ask me anything, anytime!":[3629,2438],"me|Thanks! I will work very hard!":[6217,2472],"boss|Haha, love the spirit… I guess?":[8839,3828],"me|Thanks! I'll do my best every day!":[12817,2604],"boss|Okay, don't burn out on day one!":[15570,2333],"me|Thanks! I'll get up to speed fast!":[18054,2195],"boss|No rush—just ping me anytime!":[20399,2216],"me|Thanks! I'll take you up on that!":[22765,2360],"boss|Haha, please do! My door's open!":[25275,2587]}}}